('3139', 1, '147547', 'Adheart Many Geos', 'merchant-adheart-many-geos-147547', 'adheart.me', 'https://cdn.admitad-connect.com/campaign/images/2025/12/8/147547-a91040680ba64adf.svg', 'Adheart is a subscription-based advertising analytics service for Meta Ads (Facebook and Instagram). It allows users to find, analyze, and download ad creatives from around the world in just a few clicks. The tool is essential for media buyers, marketers, and business owners working with paid traffic.The product operates on a subscription model. Users purchase access to the platform’s features and receive a daily quota for ad searches and analytics.Subscription Plans:\tStart — $70/month, includes 100 searches per day\tPro — $90/month, includes 300 searches per dayWhat Adheart Allows You to Do:\tSearch competitors’ ads by keywords, niches, countries, languages, and other filters\tDiscover “offer + creative” combinations and quickly launch your own campaigns\tAnalyze fan pages, domains, and mobile apps of market leaders\tTrack advertising trends across different niches, verticals, and countries\tDownload any creative in one click\tCreate your own collections of creativesTarget Audience:\tTargeting specialists and marketers — analyze competitors’ ads, find campaign ideas, and save time on creative production\tAffiliates and media buyers — discover winning combinations and reduce testing costs\tE-commerce store owners and dropshippers — find trending products and proven ad creative ideas used by competitorsWhy Users Choose Adheart:\tUkrainian service\tOne of the largest Meta ad databases among spy tools\tAds collected from 239 GEOs worldwide, including exotic locations\tNew ads added several times a day\tAdvanced filtering system — find virtually any ad\tAbility to download any creative in high quality without watermarksBenefits for Partners:\tCompetitive commission rate\tHigh approval rate and fast processing\t90-day cookie duration\tAdditional bonuses for top affiliates\tMarketing materials for any promotional occasion\tOpen to joint promotional campaignsRestrictions:\tRunning paid search ads on the Adheart brand is prohibited (list of negative keywords available via link)\tDouble monetization is not allowed: you cannot combine CPA commission via Admitad with RevShare earnings from Adheart’s internal referral program for the same users', '2.80', 0, 'UA,DE,AT,GB,EC,IN,IT,LV,PT,FI,CZ,SE,PL,AU,BR,GE,IL,ES,CN,KZ,MD,TR,US,HR,BG,CH,AM,EE,IE,CA,LT,RO,FR,CL', '204,195', 1, '2026-05-08 20:15:04.658181', 1, '2026-05-08 20:15:04.658181', 0, 1),
