('3150', 1, '101287', 'AURAS Travel Insurance', 'merchant-auras-travel-insurance-101287', 'auras.insure', 'https://cdn.admitad-connect.com/campaign/images/2025/7/30/101287-c260c83e79073395.svg', 'Travel Medical InsuranceAURAS is an insurance company that specializes exclusively in travel insurance. It’s a company trusted by customers worldwide.More about AURAS travel insurance:\tAURAS travel insurance is universal and unique. The insurance policy consists of one tariff plan that includes everything you need for a tourist anywhere in the world.\tThe insurance can be used by clients aged 1 to 100 years, regardless of their country, citizenship, nationality, or religion. \tThe Insurance is approved for applying for a visa, submitting documents to the embassy and visa center.\tClients can purchase insurance from 2 days to 1 year.\tThe price of the insurance policy is available immediately online on the website. You can buy it instantly on the website. The insurance policy is sent immediately after successful payment to the client''s email address.\tWebsite is adapted to many different languages.\tCustomer support specialists speak various languages. Support is available around the clock, 24/7.\tOnline check of insurance policy validity and relevance is available.\tIt is possible to buy insurance while already abroad in another country.\tAbility to add additional options to the insurance.\tPayment currency for the insurance policy is USD.Target audience description:Auras travel insurance is suitable for customers traveling around the world, including those who have already crossed the border into their destination country. The means of transportation can be any - airplane, car, bus, train, or ship. The insurance is suitable for clients traveling for a quiet vacation, active vacation, extreme vacation, athletes, competitions, as well as clients who need insurance for work, study (students), or for a visa and submission of documents to the embassy. There are no restrictions on nationality, citizenship, or religion. Any person can buy insurance.Benefits of AURAS travel insurance for clients:\tBest coverage options.\tNo hidden clauses in the contract.\tNo additional commissions.\tOne of the best all-inclusive tariffs.\tFixed price for insurance: 1.5USD per day.\tBest price among many insurance companies.\tOnline payment by credit card on the website.\tPolicy valid worldwide, electronically or self-printable.\tFast deployment.\t100% money-back guarantee.\tHigh insurance company rating.Benefits of the AURAS affiliate program:\tHighest percentage of commission for partners.\tOffer is valid worldwide.\tAdapted to different languages.\tHigh average check.\tSmart payment system (high conversion to payment).\tManager calls if the payment is not successful.\tAffiliate receives a commission on all additional sales.\tA separate page has been created for each country and sport (extreme activity), which increases the conversion to payment.\tQuick response from a support specialist on the website or by phone, which increases the conversion to payment.Affiliate program details:\tCookies are stored for affiliate traffic for 30 days.\tConversion is counted to the partner by the last click method.\tA conversion is a customer''s payment for an insurance policy on the company''s website.\tNo limits on conversions.\tReceives traffic 24/7.Recommendations on how to earn more with the AURAS affiliate program:\tUse an additional 10% off promo code for your customers – ADM10\tSell travel insurance for group travelers. Pay attention to massive international events (sports competitions, business training, educational trips, religious trips, concerts, discos).\tSell travel insurance for a long term - 3 months, 6 months, 1 year.\tSell travel insurance for seniors. The price of insurance increases if the client is over 65 years old.\tSell travel insurance for clients engaged in extreme activities and sports.\tSell travel insurance for professional athletes.Forbidden:\tContextual advertising in any search engines using the company''s branded keywords is prohibited (any variations of branded keywords in any language are prohibited).\tIt is forbidden to create (publish) groups, accounts, channels, chats, pages, profiles, websites, platforms, forums, communities, messengers, domain names on behalf of the company and/or similar to the company name.\tMotivational traffic is prohibited.If you violate the rules of the AURAS affiliate program, the partner is blocked forever. There is no possibility to resume cooperation. No possibility to receive a monetary reward.', '1.90', 0, 'BY,US,AL,AD,AQ,AM,KZ,DE,AX,AS,AT,BH,BE,BM,BQ,BV,VG,BF,CM,KY,CL,CC,CG,CI,CW,CD,DM,EC,GQ,ET,FM,FR,TF,GE,GR,AI,AR,AU,BS,BB,BJ,BO,BW,IO,BG,KH,CV,TD,CX,KM,CR,CU,CZ,DJ,UA,PL,AF,DZ,AO,AG,AW,AZ,BD,BZ,BT,BA,BR,BN,BI,CA,CF,CN,CO,CK,HR,CY,DK,DO,EG,ER,FK,FJ,GF,GA,GH,GL,GU,GN,HT,HN,IS,IR,IM,JM,JO,KW,LV,LR,LT,MK,MY,MT,GP,GG,GY,VA,HU,ID,IE,IT,JE,KI,LA,LS,LI,MO,MW,ML,SV,EE,FO,FI,PF,GM,GI,GD,GT,GW,HM,HK,IN,IQ,IL,JP,KE,KG,LB,LY,LU,MG,MV,MH,MU,MD,MR,MX,MN,MA,NA,NL,NI,NU,MP,PK,PA,PE,PT,RE,BL,LC,VC,ST,RS,SG,SI,ZA,SS,MQ,YT,MC,MS,MM,NP,NZ,NG,KP,OM,PS,PY,PN,QA,RW,KN,PM,SM,SN,SL,SK,SO,KR,LK,SJ,CH,TJ,ME,MZ,NR,NC,NE,NF,NO,PW,PG,PH,PR,RO,SH,MF,WS,SA,SC,SX,SB,GS,ES,SR,SE,TW,TH,TK,TN,TC,UG,UY,VU,WF,SD,SZ,SY,TZ,TG,TT,TM,AE,UM,UZ,VN,YE,TL,TO,TR,TV,GB,VI,VE,EH,ZW,ZM', '216,242,193', 1, '2026-05-08 20:15:04.668633', 1, '2026-05-08 20:15:04.668633', 0, 1),
