('3155', 1, '118860', 'WPS Office WW', 'merchant-wps-office-ww-118860', 'www.wps.com', 'https://cdn.admitad-connect.com/campaign/images/2025/1/16/118860-c3150395d3cedbbf.svg', ' Who Are We?\tWe are a software company with over 30 years of experience. Our flagship product, WPS Office, is a leading office suite trusted by users worldwide.\tWPS Office serves over 500 million monthly active users globally, offering seamless compatibility across Windows, mac OS, iOS, Android, and Linux. With features like document editing, spreadsheets, presentations, and PDF tools, it’s designed to help professionals work smarter.\tPowered by advanced AI technology, tools like Docs Smart Create, AI Spell Check, Slides Smart Create, and Parallel Translate deliver a fresh, efficient office experience. Why Choose WPS Office? \t  All-in-One Solution: WPS Office combines document editing, spreadsheets, presentations, and PDF tools in one lightweight app.\t  Free & Affordable: The free version is feature-rich, making it a great alternative to Microsoft Office. The paid version adds even more premium features at a low cost.\t  Cross-Platform: Switch effortlessly between web, mobile, and desktop. Work anytime, anywhere.\t  Real-Time Collaboration: Edit documents, spreadsheets, and presentations with your team online. Share feedback instantly.\t  Compatible with Microsoft Office: Open, edit, and save Word, Excel, and PowerPoint files without compatibility issues.\t  Template Library: Access thousands of templates for resumes, reports, and presentations with your WPS account.\t  Secure & Reliable: Your data is safe with us. We comply with global security standards like ISO 27701, ISO 9001, and ISO 20000.\t  Regular Updates: Our team rolls out updates frequently, introducing new features and enhancing your experience. Subscribe to WPS Pro and Get:\tAdvanced PDF Tools: Edit, convert, fill, sign, merge, and split PDF s.\tWPS Cloud: 20GB of secure cloud storage for your files.\tExclusive Templates: 10,000+ professional templates for Pro users.\tExtract Text: Extract text from PDF s or images.\tAd-Free Experience: Work without interruptions from ads. Subscribe to WPS AI and Unlock:\tDocs Smart Create: Generate articles, summaries, sales emails, and more in seconds. \tAI Spell Check: Fix spelling and grammar mistakes with one click.\t Slides Smart Create: Create professional presentations with a single command.\t Parallel Translate: Generate side-by-side translations directly in your document. Supports 100+ languages.\t Chat PDF: Summarize lengthy PDF s quickly and efficiently.\t  WPS Photos: Tools for background removal, photo enhancement, and batch processing.Try Before You Subscribe! We offer all new users a free trial to experience the features firsthand before subscribing:\t  WPS Pro: Get a 7-day free trial to explore all the premium features.\t  WPS AI: Get a 3-day free trial to discover the power of AI-driven tools. Why Join the WPS Office Affiliate Program?1. Generous Earnings2. Program Perks:\t90-Day Cookie Window\tPerformance Bonuses\tCustom Support\tFree Premium Trial3. High Conversion Rates:\tUp to 70% conversion rate from organic website visitors.            \tAd click-to-install conversion rates between 10%-30%.  Who Are Our Users?Our target audience includes educators, students, and professionals. They need a versatile and cost-effective office suite for work, study, and personal projects. 2025 Marketing Plan:\tSeasonal Promotions: Special discounts during back-to-school, Black Friday, and other shopping seasons. We run 1-2 campaigns every quarter.        \tExclusive Affiliate Deals: Customized promotions for affiliates.        \tAffiliate Rewards: Extra commissions and bonuses during key campaigns.\t Join Us Today!WPS Office is a trusted brand that delivers incredible value to both users and affiliates. Partner with us to reach a global audience and earn attractive rewards. Let’s work together for mutual success!  ', '4.20', 0, 'CH,TJ,SY,TZ,TG,TT,