('3178', 1, '142763', 'Stories of Bible AU CA UK US', 'merchant-stories-of-bible-au-ca-uk-us-142763', 'storiesofbible.com', 'https://cdn.admitad-connect.com/campaign/images/2025/9/16/142763-97755456c52de18f.svg', 'Make the whole Bible click in minutes, not months. The Bible: Made Simple bundles Old Testament: Made Simple and New Testament: Made Simple into a visual-first study set that turns 66 books into an easy, engaging journey.Every page is built for how people learn today, lists, outlines, timelines, maps, tables, and illustrated charts, so readers can see the big picture at a glance and then zoom into key moments fast. Instead of dense commentary, the guides use clear visuals, plain-language summaries, and verse references placed at the bottom of each narrative section for quick lookup.Ideal for visual learners, parents, pastors, and small-group leaders. Use either book with reading plans, for lesson or sermon prep, homeschool, or youth nights. Outcome: quicker understanding, confident navigation, and practical application without dense commentary.', '3.30', 0, 'GB,AU,CA,US', '173,185,193,238', 1, '2026-05-08 20:15:04.701299', 1, '2026-05-08 20:15:04.701299', 0, 1),
